WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.744
O wi'i: "Too, en nganndi gese bee maako, en keɓa ceede ɗiɗi".

00:00:04.824 --> 00:00:06.800
Ɗon e ɗon hayina on jaɓii.

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:15.816
Ammaa nder carel ngel ɓeydaama, e ɓaydaama e warugo leɗɗe, re'aajo boo e cembiɗinaama nder gese nder nyiwre leɗɗe.

00:00:15.896 --> 00:00:16.923
Nde ɓe njogii.

00:00:17.003 --> 00:00:23.170
Nde ɓe ngollani, ɓe keewi ko'e maɓɓe, ɓe ngullani ɗum ko ɓuri kilooji ujineere.
